        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An existing employee who accepts the Network Assistant title and is unsuccessful in meeting expectations as outlined shall be returned to his/her previous position and reporting location, if available. Should the previous position not be available for any reason, the employee may be placed into any other vacancy for which he/she is qualified as determined by the Company. Being qualified includes successfully passing any required job test associated with the position. Should the employee be unsuccessful in obtaining a position, the employee will be released from the Company.",
